---
import Eyebrow from './Eyebrow.astro';
---
<section class="section overflow-hidden bg-surface">
  <div class="orb left-[85%]! top-[-30%] w-[50vmax] opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative">
    <Eyebrow num="02" label="The approach" />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-[22ch] text-[clamp(2.2rem,5.6vw,5.75rem)] font-medium leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em]" data-scrub>
      Good websites are clear, useful and made to last.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-12">
      <p class="lead md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7" data-reveal>
        We keep the process focused: understand the business, establish the direction, design the experience and build the final site. Modern tools help us work efficiently without compromising the result.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
